  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Automated Drone and Digital Twin Infrastructure Development for Disaster Response in Indonesia(TIPS Track/2026-2028/1,100million KRW)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Despite high disaster exposure, Indonesia lacks an integrated real-time monitoring and field-based digital response system, limiting rapid situational awareness and coordinated action. Local governments face severe shortages in mapping systems, equipment, data integration platforms, and trained personnel. Disaster response often relies on manual reporting and experiential judgment rather than data driven decision making. Adoption of advanced technologies such as drones and digital twin systems remains minimal. Local authorities and implementing agencies lack adequately trained personnel and institutionalized training programs, resulting in slow and suboptimal response effectiveness.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Establishment and demonstration of a digital-based automated response system to strengthen disaster response capabilities in Indonesia, and enhancement of actual public disaster response capabilities.&#xc7ac;&#xb09c; &#xbc1c;&#xc0dd; &#xc2dc; &#xbcf4;&#xb2e4; &#xbe60;&#xb974;&#xace0; &#xc815;&#xd655;&#xd55c; &#xb300;&#xc751;&#xc744; &#xc704;&#xd55c; &#xb514;&#xc9c0;&#xd138; &#xc7ac;&#xb09c; &#xb300;&#xc751; &#xc2dc;&#xc2a4;&#xd15c; &#xac1c;&#xbc1c;, &#xc7ac;&#xb09c; &#xb300;&#xc751; &#xae30;&#xc220;&#xc744; &#xc774;&#xd574;&#xd558;&#xace0; &#xd604;&#xc7a5;&#xc5d0; &#xc801;&#xc6a9;&#xd560; &#xc218; &#xc788;&#xb294; &#xc804;&#xbb38; &#xc778;&#xb825; &#xc591;&#xc131; &#xbc0f; &#xc2e4;&#xd589;&#xc5ed;&#xb7c9; &#xc81c;&#xace0;</narrative>
  </description>
